Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm working on my art project.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.78,0:00:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember the old air-raid speakers left over from the war?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.82,0:00:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The system still works, and I've got into the main line.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.58,0:00:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now I'm broadcasting poetry all over the suburb.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.22,0:00:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to broadcast some of Sandra's poems too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.98,0:00:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.36,0:00:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have to go now. See you, Gabriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.46,0:00:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool sculpture you've got in there, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.14,0:00:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be interesting to see the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.32,0:00:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,reactions where it stands on the street.
